  "title": "Update packet-isakmp.c with RFC9370 and RFC9242",
  "description": "Hi\n\nThis is my first time using Git, so please be gentle :-)\n\nFeel free to ask me any Qs.\n\nI've updated the dissector to allow WireShark to decode the Post Qunatum handshakes in RFC9370 and RFC9242.\n\nPlease see the attached PCAP, which I obtained from; https://github.com/strongX509/docker/tree/master/pq-strongswan\n\nAnd the screenshot, which shows the traffic is now correctly decoded.\n[IKE_debug_StrongSwan_Kyber.pcapng](/uploads/556a65a5b81c333b04daf47da36529c9/IKE_debug_StrongSwan_Kyber.pcapng)\n\n[Screenshot_from_2023-10-19_08-54-57](/uploads/221ce8192388fb491a25b6b48b8f374b/Screenshot_from_2023-10-19_08-54-57.png)",
